non-failing Deferred statuses to the Rust finalizer wire, then [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]release the crate.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Adopt the released core floor and the deferral config schema[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]adopt[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]adopt: raise the sase_core_rs floor, mirror the new wire records in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase.core.finalizer_wire, and accept `refusal: fail | defer` in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]finalizer config.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Adjudicate deferrals at submit time instead of after the turn[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]adjudicate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after adopt[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]adjudicate: replace the free-text `refuse` action with typed `defer` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decisions and make `sase final submit` reject unfounded deferrals as [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]repairable validation errors while the agent still holds its context.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]A deliberate deferral escape hatch that does not fail the run[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]escape[dim] · [dim][/dim]after adjudicate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]escape: add `sase final defer`, honor `refusal: defer` in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]controller, and report a deferred turn as a completed run with a dirty [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tree that the user is told about, instead of a FAILED run with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stranded workspace.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Publish the commit consent model where agents actually read it[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]consent[dim] · [dim][/dim]after adjudicate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]consent: carry the commit-by-default rule and per-repository provenance [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]evidence in `sase final context` output, rewrite the `/sase_final` skill[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]around authoring, and remove the self-contradiction in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]declaration-recovery prompt.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Historical regression corpus, live acceptance, telemetry, and [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]docs[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]acceptance[dim] · [dim][/dim]after escape, consent[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]acceptance: replay every historical refusal as a regression fixture, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prove the protocol live end to end, add refusal and deferral telemetry, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and synchronize the finalizer documentation.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-sp","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-sp.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-34c9c4137d9505036b795e85eaa00c62","started_at":"2026-08-24T13:20:53.258327+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"ba47cbb48915185bbb2edf9b63ede072a4d3fce456948f37100b06ac4d879c66","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-sp.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"98960b1d795713bff695a1758dd93ba4ecdd1a477eb167a59129a401537117d4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-sp.land/meta.json","size_bytes":605},"prompt":{"digest":"10f2ec592dcd94a6a45eb8d4e52734297ccd73400c8bda3d39a4b862eaea9351","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-sp.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":279},"state":{"digest":"d2a453608d767ee24c6096fe9dc21214d326294bc0956dbe38852a7cef415ee9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-sp.l